      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Arthur’s layout sprang from the Chicago & Northwestern Railroad, with a depot and rail lines shaping the town’s early streets.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
